@Zrobim.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5262

### Is the API up and can it reach PostgreSQL?
GET {{Zrobim.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Register a client
POST {{Zrobim.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anya@example.com",
  "password": "Test-pass-123",
  "firstName": "Аня",
  "lastName": "Ковальчук",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### Register a master (gets a PENDING master profile)
POST {{Zrobim.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "olya@example.com",
  "password": "Test-pass-123",
  "firstName": "Оля",
  "phone": "+375291234567",
  "role": "MASTER"
}

### Sign in — copy "accessToken" from the response into @token below
POST {{Zrobim.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anya@example.com",
  "password": "Test-pass-123"
}

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### The signed-in user
GET {{Zrobim.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
